{
  "title": "Waypoint - Invoice Assurance Outcomes",
  "locked": false,
  "description": "Waypoint outcomes chapter showing the published invoice assurance application in action, including approved and recovery recommendations, side-by-side run comparison, traceable run history, operational telemetry, and the full arc from local prototype to production-ready business workflow.",
