        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "- Now let's look at the application we've built and published.\n- This is where everything we've been working on comes together.",
      "demo_actions": "Open the published Waypoint application and land on the main invoice view. Frame this as the point where the full workflow becomes visible to the business.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111154_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.11.27@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "- Here we're looking at our invoices.\n- The agents have already analyzed each one and categorized them based on the evidence they found.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the invoice list with visible categories and statuses so the viewer can see that analysis has already been completed across the set.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111253_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.11.27@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~15s",
      "narrative": "- Let's start with an invoice that was approved.",
      "demo_actions": "Open an approved invoice from the list and transition into the detail view.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111259_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.12.21@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "- At a glance, we can see the agent's decision, the confidence behind it, and, most importantly, the evidence that supports that decision.\n- We can drill into the supporting documents, review the evidence trail, and even see every tool the agent used to reach its conclusion.",
      "demo_actions": "In the approved invoice detail view, point out the decision, confidence, linked documents, evidence trail, and tool usage history.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "- That evidence trail is really the key.\n- Instead of asking us to simply trust the AI, the application shows exactly why it believes this invoice should be paid.",
      "demo_actions": "Pause on the evidence trail and emphasize how the reasoning is exposed through traceable supporting details.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~15s",
      "narrative": "- Now let's compare that to a recovery recommendation.",
      "demo_actions": "Switch from the approved invoice to an invoice marked for recovery or dispute.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111347_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.13.26@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "- Here, the agent determined the invoice shouldn't be paid as submitted.\n- Once again, we can inspect the supporting documents, review the evidence that led to the recommendation, and follow the complete reasoning behind the decision.",
      "demo_actions": "Walk through the recovery recommendation details, including supporting documents, evidence, and the chain of reasoning that led to the decision.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "- One capability I particularly like is that we aren't limited to a single agent run.\n- As we're experimenting with different models or prompts, we can compare multiple runs side by side to understand how different approaches affect the outcome.",
      "demo_actions": "Open the side-by-side run comparison view and show how different model or prompt runs can be reviewed together.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "- In this case, the application has even generated a reviewer draft that helps prepare a response for disputing the invoice, giving the reviewer a strong starting point instead of beginning from scratch.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the generated reviewer draft and explain how it helps the reviewer prepare a dispute response faster.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
