        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "- On the right, we can monitor expert and tool usage, understand which capabilities are contributing the most value, and even measure how much money each one has helped recover.\n- We can also track trends over time, such as whether overall financial risk is increasing or decreasing.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the telemetry panel and call out expert usage, tool contribution, recovery value, and risk trends over time.",
