      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "- We started with an idea running locally in the GitHub Copilot app.\n- We refined it inside Visual Studio Code, published the agents into Foundry, connected them through Teams, and ultimately delivered a web application that anyone in the organization can use.",
      "demo_actions": "Summarize the end-to-end journey from local prototype to published business application while staying on the application overview.",
